{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tower_stone","model_identifier":"tower_stone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tower_stone\n\nStone tower: a 3 x 3 column platform for ranged units, with a parapet and four standing points (`slot_tower_1..4`), a ladder or stair door at the back.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 3 columns (48 x 48 units, 1.35 x 1.35 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -26..26, y 0..179, z -26..26 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material (repainted in Patch 5 for colour contrast).\n- Cubes: 41, all in `finished`; the construction and ruined state sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in Patch 5 (the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 178 x 48 centred at the origin\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, 32)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-12, 171, -12)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (12, 171, -12)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-12, 171, 12)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (12, 171, 12)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"stone_tw_base#aba79d","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26,0,-26],"to":[26,6,26],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40,210,92,216],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[92,210,144,216],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[144,210,196,216],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[196,210,248,216],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[258,0,310,52],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[310,0,362,52],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ff58ea16-a6d9-592b-bb5e-50283fb8bf94"},{"name":"stone_tw_body#aba79d","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24,6,-24],"to":